- **NEXT:** `./run.sh 2 tcp dir_reuse_coherency`, grep `P32B-DOUBLEMAP`. If it fires → AG free-space double-alloc confirmed → fix the AG-free-space cross-node coherency (drain on AG release + invalidate/reload on AG acquire; see sess42/43/47). If not → the clobbered block is a freed prior incarnation (benign) and the real loss is (c) — pursue GPT's full-closure release barrier (targeted bwrite of AGF/bnobt, NOT deadlock-prone `xfs_ail_push_all_sync`).
